      "statement": "step ca rekey rejects expired certificates, generates a new key from --kty/--curve/--size or loads an existing --private-key KMS-aware, reuses the renew jitter and daemon scheduling, writes the private key at 0600 only when no key was provided or --out-key is set, and its help states --kms rekeys within the same KMS and does not support generating new keys, --daemon, or cross-KMS rekeying.",
