      "statement": "step ca revoke accepts a serial (parsed as big.Int in any base) or --cert/--key with no positional args, is incompatible with --offline and --token, infers the serial from the certificate bundle in the mTLS path (validated via OfflineCA.VerifyClientCert offline), requires a supplied --token's subject to match the serial case-insensitively, and pins the root by the token sha claim or requires --ca-url plus an existing root file.",
