      "id": "claim_eca5f48bb8c54d57ad6f639b6808e472",
      "statement": "step ssh renew works only for host certificates: it parses the SSH certificate serial, sets --sshpop-cert/--sshpop-key in the context to select the SSHPOP provisioner, generates an SSHRenewType token, calls client.SSHRenew, and writes the new certificate in OpenSSH format at 0644 plus any returned identity certificate.",
