      "statement": "step certificate needs-renewal returns exit 0 when the certificate needs renewal (past 66% of its lifetime by default, or within an --expires-in duration), exit 1 otherwise, exit 2 when the file is missing, and 255 for other errors; a URL argument fetches the peer chain (verifiable with --roots), and --bundle checks the whole chain instead of only the leaf.",
